Design v2 (plan/spec/desktop-v2), downloaded 28.10.2026 with Georg's OK from github.com/google/fonts (main, ofl/):
- Bricolage Grotesque 500, 600: static instances (opsz 48, wdth 100) of BricolageGrotesque[opsz,wdth,wght].ttf,
