- Figtree 400-700: static instances of Figtree[wght].ttf. OFL-Figtree.txt.
- JetBrains Mono 400-600: static instances of JetBrainsMono[wght].ttf. OFL-JetBrainsMono.txt.
All SIL Open Font License 1.1, no Reserved Font Name. Not in any of them: U+2713 U+2717 (check, cross); Bricolage and
Figtree also lack U+25BE U+25B8 U+25CF (triangles, dot): draw those as icons.
